1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,755
Your fingers close around a cup. The robot almost does.
你的手捏住杯子，机器人却差了一点。

2
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:07,035
For camera-only teleoperation,
只用摄像头进行遥操作，

3
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:10,535
which three-dimensional tracking method is actually more accurate?
哪种三维手部动捕更准？

4
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:13,395
Welcome to DoF Infra, episode four.
欢迎来到 DoF Infra 第四期。

5
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:17,148
We will follow one pinch, from pixels to physical contact.
这次跟着一次捏合，从像素走到真实接触。

6
00:00:17,498 --> 00:00:19,793
For precision, I would start with
精度优先，我会先选择

7
00:00:19,818 --> 00:00:22,733
synchronized, calibrated cameras from different angles.
同步、标定的多视角相机。

8
00:00:22,758 --> 00:00:26,793
Use depth where it is reliable, then fit a consistent hand model.
深度可靠时加入深度，再拟合连续的手模型。

9
00:00:26,818 --> 00:00:30,373
That is an engineering starting point, not a universal winner.
这是工程起点，不是通用精度冠军。

10
00:00:30,398 --> 00:00:34,638
The object, viewing angles, and control delay can change the answer.
物体、观察角度和控制延迟都会改变结果。

11
00:00:35,082 --> 00:00:36,697
Start with a depth frame.
从一帧深度图开始。

12
00:00:36,722 --> 00:00:39,297
Isolate the hand from the object and background.
先将人手与物体、背景分离。

13
00:00:39,322 --> 00:00:43,097
Each valid depth pixel, together with camera intrinsics,
每个有效深度像素，结合相机内参，

14
00:00:43,122 --> 00:00:45,377
maps to a three-dimensional surface point.
就能还原为三维表面点。

15
00:00:45,402 --> 00:00:49,677
Together, these points sample the visible surface, not the hidden side.
这些点采样可见表面，并不包含被挡住的背面。

16
00:00:49,702 --> 00:00:54,302
Calibrated views can contribute more observed surfaces in one coordinate frame.
标定后的视角可以在同一坐标系补充可见表面。

17
00:00:54,771 --> 00:00:59,766
A point cloud records surfaces. Joint centers usually sit inside the hand.
点云记录表面；关节中心通常位于手内部。

18
00:00:59,791 --> 00:01:01,646
A model estimates a skeleton
模型估计出人手骨架，

19
00:01:01,671 --> 00:01:04,586
from image or depth evidence and anatomical constraints.
依据图像或深度证据，以及人体结构约束。

20
00:01:04,611 --> 00:01:08,326
Separate global wrist motion from local finger articulation.
把手腕整体运动与手指局部弯曲分开。

21
00:01:08,351 --> 00:01:11,091
The same pinch can move anywhere in space.
同一捏合姿态可以发生在不同空间位置。

22
00:01:11,573 --> 00:01:16,088
An articulated mesh represents the hand with vertices and connected faces.
关节驱动的 Mesh 用顶点和相连的面来表示人手。

23
00:01:16,113 --> 00:01:19,128
In MANO, shape describes hand proportions;
在 MANO 中，形状描述手的比例；

24
00:01:19,153 --> 00:01:21,508
pose describes joint rotations.
姿态描述关节旋转。

25
00:01:21,533 --> 00:01:23,648
Skinning moves the surface with the joints.
蒙皮让手表面随关节变形。

26
00:01:23,673 --> 00:01:27,828
Fit the model to observed landmarks or surfaces, with anatomical priors.
用观测到的关键点或表面，加上人体结构先验来拟合模型。

27
00:01:27,853 --> 00:01:31,293
A plausible hidden finger is still inferred, not measured.
看似合理的隐藏手指，仍然是推断而非测量。

28
00:01:31,643 --> 00:01:34,298
Reconstructing one frame gives a pose.
重建一帧，得到一个姿态。

29
00:01:34,323 --> 00:01:37,658
Motion capture tracks how that pose changes over time.
动捕跟踪姿态随时间的变化。

30
00:01:37,683 --> 00:01:42,558
Keep finger identities consistent, and track wrist motion and articulation together.
保持手指身份一致，同时跟踪手腕运动和关节变化。

31
00:01:42,583 --> 00:01:46,078
A fixed template gives vertices consistent identities;
固定模板让顶点编号保持一致；

32
00:01:46,103 --> 00:01:49,278
their positions still have to be estimated in every frame.
每一帧的顶点位置仍需重新估计。

33
00:01:49,303 --> 00:01:51,658
Temporal constraints reduce jitter,
时序约束能抑制抖动，

34
00:01:51,683 --> 00:01:55,123
but predicted motion during occlusion still carries uncertainty.
但遮挡期间预测的运动仍有不确定性。

35
00:01:55,684 --> 00:01:59,059
There is no compulsory point-cloud-to-mesh pipeline.
点云到网格，并不是所有方法都必须走的流程。

36
00:01:59,084 --> 00:02:03,519
HaMeR predicts a parametric hand mesh directly from an RGB image.
HaMeR 直接从 RGB 图像预测参数化手模型。

37
00:02:03,544 --> 00:02:09,019
DexPilot combines depth observations, estimated joints, and articulated model tracking.
DexPilot 结合深度观测、关节估计与关节模型跟踪。

38
00:02:09,044 --> 00:02:12,519
For teleoperation, extract wrist and fingertip targets,
遥操作还要提取手腕与指尖目标，

39
00:02:12,544 --> 00:02:14,364
then retarget them to the robot.
再将这些目标映射到机器人。

40
00:02:14,949 --> 00:02:18,724
A single RGB camera is a convenient first prototype.
单目 RGB 很适合快速搭建原型。

41
00:02:18,749 --> 00:02:22,484
But different three-dimensional hands can project to similar images.
不同的三维手势，可能投影成相似图像。

42
00:02:22,509 --> 00:02:27,184
HaMeR reports six millimeters on FreiHAND after Procrustes alignment.
HaMeR 的对齐后关节误差为六毫米。

43
00:02:27,209 --> 00:02:31,384
That alignment removes translation, rotation, and scale differences.
这种对齐会消除平移、旋转和尺度差异。

44
00:02:31,409 --> 00:02:35,589
It does not promise six-millimeter accuracy in your robot coordinates.
它不保证机器人坐标下也有六毫米精度。

45
00:02:36,132 --> 00:02:40,447
A second view helps when it reveals what the first camera cannot see.
第二视角的价值，在于看见第一台的盲区。

46
00:02:40,472 --> 00:02:44,567
Calibrate every camera into the same frame and synchronize exposures.
所有相机要统一坐标，并同步曝光时间。

47
00:02:44,592 --> 00:02:49,027
Otherwise, a moving fingertip is fused from different places or times.
否则，运动指尖会被跨位置、跨时间地融合。

48
00:02:49,052 --> 00:02:52,367
HO-Cap illustrates calibrated multi-view reconstruction.
HO-Cap 展示了标定的多视角重建。

49
00:02:52,392 --> 00:02:55,586
Its annotation pipeline is not live control.
它的标注流程，不等于实时控制。

50
00:02:55,936 --> 00:02:59,771
AnyTeleop offers a useful comparison inside one system.
AnyTeleop 给出了同一系统内的对比。

51
00:02:59,796 --> 00:03:04,991
In its simulated piano task, wrong-key rates fell from twenty-eight point one percent,
仿真钢琴任务中，误按率从百分之二十八点一，

52
00:03:05,016 --> 00:03:08,051
to twenty-one point eight, then twelve point five,
降至二十一点八，再到十二点五，

53
00:03:08,076 --> 00:03:11,691
using RGB, RGB-D, and two RGB-D cameras.
分别对应 RGB、RGB-D 和双 RGB-D。

54
00:03:11,716 --> 00:03:14,371
One trained operator, ten trials per setup.
同一熟练操作者，每组十次试验。

55
00:03:14,396 --> 00:03:17,536
Task evidence, not sensor error in millimeters.
这是任务表现，不是毫米级传感器误差。

56
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:21,095
Now turn the hand sideways and hold the cup.
现在把手转向侧面，再握住杯子。

57
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:24,855
A model can predict hidden joints from anatomy and recent motion.
模型能用手部结构与近期运动推断隐藏关节。

58
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:28,235
Prediction is useful, but it is not a new observation.
预测很有用，但并不等于新的观测。

59
00:03:28,260 --> 00:03:32,735
When confidence drops, reduce motion, hold, or stop according to the task.
置信度下降时，应按任务减速、保持或停止。

60
00:03:32,760 --> 00:03:37,120
Recovery should be gradual, rather than snapping the robot to a new pose.
恢复跟踪要渐进，避免机器人突然跳姿态。

61
00:03:37,587 --> 00:03:42,322
Tracking is only the first half. Human and robot hands have different geometry.
动捕只完成一半，人手与机器人的结构不同。

62
00:03:42,347 --> 00:03:45,642
Copying joint angles can leave the robot pinch open.
直接复制关节角，机器人可能捏不拢。

63
00:03:45,667 --> 00:03:51,022
Retarget fingertip relationships, thumb opposition, and wrist pose, within robot limits.
应在关节限制内映射指尖关系、拇指对掌与腕姿。

64
00:03:51,047 --> 00:03:54,102
Then verify actual robot motion and contact.
再验证实际机器人的运动与接触。

65
00:03:54,127 --> 00:03:56,947
A virtual touch is not a measured grip force.
虚拟触碰，不是实测握力。

66
00:03:57,450 --> 00:03:59,725
Measure delay across the whole chain:
延迟需要测整条链路：

67
00:03:59,750 --> 00:04:03,625
exposure, estimation, communication, and robot response.
曝光、估计、通信，再到机器人响应。

68
00:04:03,650 --> 00:04:06,685
A high frame rate alone does not tell you that delay.
帧率高，不代表整条链路延迟低。

69
00:04:06,710 --> 00:04:10,405
Smoothing can reduce jitter while making fast pinches arrive late.
平滑能抑制抖动，也可能让快速捏合滞后。

70
00:04:10,430 --> 00:04:15,250
Report both typical delay and the slowest tail, such as the ninety-fifth percentile.
既要报典型延迟，也要看第九十五百分位。

71
00:04:15,796 --> 00:04:20,151
Before choosing cameras, repeat the same grasp under the same controller.
选相机前，用同一控制器重复相同抓取。

72
00:04:20,176 --> 00:04:25,011
Test open fingers, precise pinches, side views, occlusion, and reappearance.
测试张手、精细捏合、侧视、遮挡与重新出现。

73
00:04:25,036 --> 00:04:27,311
Check absolute wrist and fingertip error
检查腕部和指尖的绝对误差，

74
00:04:27,336 --> 00:04:29,451
against an independent reference where visible.
以可见时的独立参考为依据。

75
00:04:29,476 --> 00:04:31,711
Keep missing reference frames explicit.
明确标出参考缺失的帧。

76
00:04:31,736 --> 00:04:35,236
Count tracking loss, delay, failed grasps, and drops.
再统计掉踪、延迟、抓取失败与掉物。

77
00:04:35,676 --> 00:04:37,591
My camera-only recommendation:
纯视觉方案，我的建议是：

78
00:04:37,616 --> 00:04:41,711
RGB for a quick prototype, RGB-D for a fixed workspace,
RGB 快速验证，RGB-D 从固定工作区起步，

79
00:04:41,736 --> 00:04:46,231
and calibrated multi-view capture when precision and occlusion justify the setup.
精度与遮挡要求更高时，升级标定的多视角。

80
00:04:46,256 --> 00:04:48,371
Start with two complementary views;
先从两个互补视角开始，

81
00:04:48,396 --> 00:04:51,291
add more only when measured failures justify them.
再根据实测失败决定是否补充相机。

82
00:04:51,316 --> 00:04:55,311
The goal is a repeatable grasp, not just a convincing digital hand.
目标是可重复的抓取，而不只是好看的数字手。

83
00:04:55,336 --> 00:04:57,949
Explore the sources in the DoF research map.
在 DoF 研究地图里继续查看原始论文。
